2. Definitions. In this Act, unless there is anything repugnant in the subject or context,__
(1) “building” includes a building as defined in the City of Lahore Corporation Act, 1941 (Punjab XV of 1941), and in the Punjab Municipal Act, 1911 (Punjab III of 1911);
(2) “Committee” means a Committee constituted under section 3 of this Act;
(3) “Government” means the Government of West Pakistan;
(4) “graveyard” means a graveyard to which all or any of the provisions of this Act, have been extended;
(5) “High Court” means the High Court of West Pakistan;
(6) “land” includes land defined in the Land Acquisition Act, 1894 (I of 1894);
(7) “prescribed” means prescribed by rules made by the Government under this Act;
and
(8) “Tribunal” means a Tribunal constituted under section 7 of this Act.

